# Governance

How decisions about {{ project_name }} are made, who makes them, and how the project
carries on if a maintainer is gone. [CONTRIBUTING.md](.github/CONTRIBUTING.md) says how
to propose a change.

## Decisions

<!-- Who decides, and how: one maintainer decides, or maintainers agree by consensus.
     Where disagreements go. Larger decisions are recorded in docs/decisions/. -->

The maintainers decide. A change lands when a maintainer approves its pull request.
Decisions that shape the project are recorded in [docs/decisions/](docs/decisions/README.md).

